  m_text: 'Halloween night, 1997.


    You and your best friend Lou made a pact:
    hide in Hollow Creek Elementary after the carnival, wait until everyone has gone,
    and catch the Knocking Ghost on tape.


    You hid under the coats in Room 12
    to wait...


    ...and fell asleep.'
