--- !u!114 &1892682201
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1892682198}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d2c8360bb7b1c4b2b862663d1c184e45, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VoiceLines
  radio: {fileID: 1892682199}
  captions: {fileID: 1417538499}
  settings: {fileID: 1335939010}
  audioRouting: {fileID: 551228607}
  localVoice: {fileID: 2028854182}
  radioVoice: {fileID: 1566440412}
  lines:
  - id: lou_00
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 186eaf531e12646bba2c5a82fe47da50, type: 3}
    caption: "\u2014am? Sam, please. Anyone. Over."
  - id: lou_01
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39917c861e9784d5c81227de7fb1abc8, type: 3}
    caption: Sam?! I've been calling for hours. I hid to jump out at you, and then
      I was falling, and now it's pitch black. I don't know where I am. My flashlight
      broke.
  - id: lou_02
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c7003b20272114e758c308f3cf434c57, type: 3}
    caption: Boxes, I think. Sheets. And something laughs every time I move.
  - id: lou_02b
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a6bd57703f7464cfeae4ad331972ebca, type: 3}
    caption: That!
  - id: lou_03
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e2a768b54dabc433f81dc740774a0e88, type: 3}
    caption: My battery is almost dead. I'm gonna hold the button down so you can
      hear what I hear. Bang on stuff, Sam. I'll tell you if it's close.
  - id: lou_04
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 105ab39167c81486fb24fd419dc4a7db, type: 3}
    caption: "Was that you? I heard it in the pipes\u2026 but it's everywhere."
  - id: lou_05
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74e2107e753234fb993a21cd846cdacc, type: 3}
    caption: I hear you, Sam. Keep going.
  - id: lou_06
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89cb31e45b9974c5d9cd4f7005e534a9, type: 3}
    caption: That was far away.
  - id: lou_07
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c5bb22891922349ab8dc006f6b41ea4c, type: 3}
    caption: The laugh again... no, that one sounded different. Closer.
  - id: lou_08
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 61893684fba7140159292691928e232e, type: 3}
    caption: Closer... I think.
  - id: lou_09
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4c24202e502cc4f79ab4f2b0744e79fc, type: 3}
    caption: Warmer.
  - id: lou_10
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 73b8cedbd03014179b4168197272cd8d, type: 3}
    caption: Close... but not there.
  - id: lou_11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ba0255b50e9e0437eae88aba73ccfa7b, type: 3}
    caption: "That! That's right next to me! Sam, I think that's what I fell out
      of... the light's blinking... please don't leave me down h\u2014"
  - id: lou_12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8a7c39710b98d488da44ac811a950cfb, type: 3}
    caption: BOO!
  - id: lou_13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c9ba46a9ab2924ebba627daabafabeb9, type: 3}
    caption: Got you.
  - id: lou_14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 594d8c5340a17430abb25958b3a52b7e, type: 3}
    caption: Did you get the Knocking Ghost on tape?
  - id: sam_00
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 233b18286cf5945b5b2fa035f577744b, type: 3}
    caption: Lou? I fell asleep. Are you there? Over.
  - id: sam_01
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 124549a5b591844428bdc295031db129, type: 3}
    caption: Lou! It's me! I fell asleep. Where are you?
  - id: sam_02
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: be65c378107094e88aa67047c1ba90d9, type: 3}
    caption: What's down there with you?
  - id: sam_03
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3a86695281a44d109cd3bd2ddefcb07, type: 3}
    caption: She can't hear me while she's holding it.
  - id: sam_04
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e9169d33941e94fcd9d40213e8cca561, type: 3}
    caption: Not without Lou.
  - id: sam_05
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe6a5b57147a6473d92411183bb5c9c2, type: 3}
    caption: Just pumpkin bread.
  - id: sam_06
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Just a wall.
  - id: sam_07
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d9096f2c9971e42f8bc910180e6e9d3b, type: 3}
    caption: Mom's PTA radio. It was stuck on talk the whole time.
  - id: sam_08
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39767b09e9cb944fc80c198124448511, type: 3}
    caption: Lou's candy pail. She was in here.
  - id: sam_09
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d657e5f0daa064afaa0e0a0c9750018d, type: 3}
    caption: If I go down too, there's nobody to crank us back up.
  - id: sam_10
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd36d30ff8646449694cc2b63baea0b4, type: 3}
    caption: Lou? Lou, can you hear me?
  - id: sam_11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6a4e92802ae9c4baea3e3bbcfddaff8a, type: 3}
    caption: She's at the bottom of that lift. I have to get her up.
  - id: sam_12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 45b176117376846da87dd6b7f93d0a2c, type: 3}
    caption: Lou! The cupboard's back! Follow my voice!
  - id: sam_13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 87df0a94810db42cea8b3ff0c6773be1, type: 3}
    caption: Keep coming! You're close!
  - id: sam_14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7582cf52cb1d247569f76b5a46acdb65, type: 3}
    caption: Climb in. I'll pull you up.
  - id: sam_15
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0352c494a597b417b939cd81d3c54919, type: 3}
    caption: Yeah. It was you.
  - id: sam_h1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a7442ba24d994c9ba225c2fb4d0720f, type: 3}
    caption: Something's glowing under that crate.
  - id: sam_h2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4eae381b82dff4319af731220c71733c, type: 3}
    caption: "If she\u2019s holding that button, anything loud near her should come
      through."
  - id: sam_h3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c04c7a1bc52264a6e9ff8e119ffb1069, type: 3}
    caption: She said she fell. Fell from where?
  - id: sam_h4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ef348d241c6234d4484f47fde5a8de43, type: 3}
    caption: The crank... I could send the lift down to her.
  - id: sam_h5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d62c44b0476424066901d5ccaca9e2eb, type: 3}
    caption: She can't see it. It's pitch black down there.
  - id: sam_h6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f4fef200a275c4f088e77567e5b9031c, type: 3}
    caption: She needs something to follow.
  - id: sam_h7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3a6cee6f30d8e41d48eb447fb0848ceb, type: 3}
    caption: The PTA radio... if she could hear me down there.
  - id: sam_h8
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: It's coming from the other side of this wall.
--- !u!114 &1892682202
